          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Released as a mail-order game via Dreamcast Direct, this version allows players to select between four fighting styles based on each Darkstalkers game (the original, Night Warriors, Vampire Savior, Savior 2 and Hunter 2) and features an online versus mode. All characters from previous entries of the Darkstalkers series are included and playable.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Lanzado como juego por correo a través de Dreamcast Direct, esta versión permite elegir entre cuatro estilos de lucha basados en cada juego de Darkstalkers (el original, Night Warriors, Vampire Savior, Savior 2 y Hunter 2) e incluye un modo versus en línea. Todos los personajes de entregas anteriores de la serie Darkstalkers están incluidos y son jugables.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2000",
          "source": "igdb",
